    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ordinary Top-Down Shooter </strong> is an ordinary top-down shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust me<br>This ordinary top-down shooter game, while ordinary, is fun<br>Just like ordinary you and ordinary me<br>Compared to geniuses, we're all ordinary<br>But if we put our heart into it<br>we are all interesting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe I can't convince you this game is fun<br>But you came to Steam<br>aren't you looking for a fun game?<br>Why not download the free Demo and give it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-Shot Kill Hardcore Combat: Whether it's you or most enemies, everyone is extremely fragile. Every firefight is full of tension; precise shooting, quick reflexes, and using the environment are key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Traditional Upgrades: I don't like upgrade systems because they make it hard for me to know if it's a skill issue or if I just didn't grind enough levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Story About Ordinary People: It explores the story of an ordinary person struggling within their dreams.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ordinary Top-Down Shooter Game</strong> is dedicated to all the ordinary people who strive and persist.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ordinary Top-Down Shooter </strong> is an ordinary top-down shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust me<br>This ordinary top-down shooter game, while ordinary, is fun<br>Just like ordinary you and ordinary me<br>Compared to geniuses, we're all ordinary<br>But if we put our heart into it<br>we are all interesting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe I can't convince you this game is fun<br>But you came to Steam<br>aren't you looking for a fun game?<br>Why not download the free Demo and give it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-Shot Kill Hardcore Combat: Whether it's you or most enemies, everyone is extremely fragile. Every firefight is full of tension; precise shooting, quick reflexes, and using the environment are key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Traditional Upgrades: I don't like upgrade systems because they make it hard for me to know if it's a skill issue or if I just didn't grind enough levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Story About Ordinary People: It explores the story of an ordinary person struggling within their dreams.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ordinary Top-Down Shooter Game</strong> is dedicated to all the ordinary people who strive and persist.</p>",
